Talisman BBS v0.24 (Win32 Setup)
   https://talismandocs.com/

 * Uses Squish Message Bases
 * Supports door32.sys, door.sys
   and chain.txt
 * Configured via INI and TOML
   text files.
 * Works on Linux & Windows 10
 * IP auto blocking
 * SSH support, latest libssh
 * QWK-E offline mail
 * LUA Scripting
 * Support for Terminal sizes
   larger than 80x25
 * Open Source, GNU GPLv3
